# IntelliJ HTTP Client - local Sara Protocol API
# Start PostgreSQL: docker compose up -d postgres
# Start service: cp .env.example .env && cargo run
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@personaId = 1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create a confirmed memory (requires an existing persona)
POST {{baseUrl}}/personas/{{personaId}}/memories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Prefers short, direct answers.",
  "source": "conversation",
  "observed_at": "2026-10-28T12:00:00Z",
  "confirmation_status": "confirmed"
}

### Create an inferred memory
POST {{baseUrl}}/personas/{{personaId}}/memories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "May enjoy science fiction.",
  "source": "inference",
  "observed_at": "2026-10-28T12:00:00Z",
  "confirmation_status": "inferred"
}

### List memories belonging to this persona
GET {{baseUrl}}/personas/{{personaId}}/memories

### Verify missing persona returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/personas/999999999/memories
